  "description": "You may encounter rough weather while pulling the cargo, so this epithelial truck tonneau which covers the back of the pickup truck will provide total cargo protection. When you pass a bumpy road, it helps to keep cargo inside the truck and prevents items dropping from your vehicle while delivering. The truck tonneau cover will shield your cargo from the heavy rain and strong wind when you are pulling the cargo. This is no doubt an item safety enforcer for you.\nFitment\nfor 1999-2016 Ford F-250 F250 Super Duty 8 ft\nfor 1999-2016 Ford F-350 F350 Super Duty 8 ft\nfor 2017-2026 Ford F-250 F250 Super Duty 8 ft\nfor 2017-2026 Ford F-350 F350 Super Duty 8 ft\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit:\nEach cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the\n8'/96.0in bed of 2017-2026 Ford F-250/F-350/ F250/F350 Super Duty.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nWHY Quad Fold: More access room when folded up, more durable with one\nmore cross bar and two more firm clamps than trifold cover.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the\nbed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from\nsliding or blowing off while driving.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.",
